Protocol: W3_OpenAuth_FinalWeek3 

Types: 
  Agent A,B,P,IdP; 
  Number R,Right,Na; 
  Constant photo; 
  Function pk,h,pwd; 

Knowledge: 
  A: A,B,P,IdP,pk(IdP),pk(B),pk(P),h,pwd(A,IdP); 
  P: A,B,P,IdP,pk(IdP),pk(P),inv(pk(P)); 
  B: A,B,P,IdP,pk(IdP),pk(P),photo; 
  IdP: A,B,P,IdP,pk(IdP),inv(pk(IdP)),pk(P),pk(B),h,pwd(A,IdP); 

Actions: 
  A -> IdP: A,P,B,R,Right 
  IdP -> A: Na 
  A -> IdP: h(pwd(A,IdP),Na,A,P,B,R,Right) 
  IdP -> A: {A,P,B,R,Right}inv(pk(IdP)) 
  A -> P: {A,P,B,R,Right}inv(pk(IdP)) 
  P -> B: {A,P,B,R,Right}inv(pk(IdP)) 
  B -> P: {photo}pk(P) 

Goals: 
  pwd(A,IdP) secret between A,IdP 
  IdP authenticates A on Na